{"4680960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fire Lookout: Abandoned Post", "steam_appid": 4680960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4741760], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire Lookout: Abandoned Post is a first-person narrative-driven mystery game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a newly hired fire lookout stationed deep in Summit Ridge National Park, you spend your days exploring the atmospheric landscape and connecting with colleagues. As you settle in, you can't shake the feeling that something is off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you begin to act on that feeling, you start to uncover the truth, but at what cost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680960/extras/79960cefeafb46c3b45cf19a3b0e1044.poster.avif?t=1782851872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680960/extras/79960cefeafb46c3b45cf19a3b0e1044.webm?t=1782851872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680960/extras/79960cefeafb46c3b45cf19a3b0e1044.mp4?t=1782851872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a first-person, slow-burning narrative experience with orientation-based exploration through a semi-open world map, and conversation-based progression through alternative decisions. Throughout the story you will be given clues as to what happened. Players are encouraged to explore, pay attention to details, and try to solve the mystery of what really happened in Summit Ridge National Park.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment with a large, interactable world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decision-based progression through radio conversations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world exploration and orientation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character voice acting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fire Lookout: Abandoned Post</i> is all about telling an immersive and interesting story. Mystery solving, the answer will not always be handed to you, it is up to the player to solve the mystery. If your style of games includes lore-rich, deep narrative experiences with simple mechanical additions, we believe this is the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680960/extras/b00595596cdd0567fe501ebf4cc652b6.avif?t=1782851872\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680960/extras_big/b00595596cdd0567fe501ebf4cc652b6.webp?t=1782851872 width=1560 height=780 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire Lookout: Abandoned Post is a first-person narrative-driven mystery game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a newly hired fire lookout stationed deep in Summit Ridge National Park, you spend your days exploring the atmospheric landscape and connecting with colleagues. As you settle in, you can't shake the feeling that something is off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you begin to act on that feeling, you start to uncover the truth, but at what cost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680960/extras/79960cefeafb46c3b45cf19a3b0e1044.poster.avif?t=1782851872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680960/extras/79960cefeafb46c3b45cf19a3b0e1044.webm?t=1782851872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680960/extras/79960cefeafb46c3b45cf19a3b0e1044.mp4?t=1782851872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a first-person, slow-burning narrative experience with orientation-based exploration through a semi-open world map, and conversation-based progression through alternative decisions. Throughout the story you will be given clues as to what happened. Players are encouraged to explore, pay attention to details, and try to solve the mystery of what really happened in Summit Ridge National Park.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment with a large, interactable world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decision-based progression through radio conversations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world exploration and orientation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character voice acting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fire Lookout: Abandoned Post</i> is all about telling an immersive and interesting story. Mystery solving, the answer will not always be handed to you, it is up to the player to solve the mystery. If your style of games includes lore-rich, deep narrative experiences with simple mechanical additions, we believe this is the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4680960/extras/b00595596cdd0567fe501ebf4cc652b6.avif?t=1782851872\" data-big-src=https:/